docs {
  # Get Post Thread
  
  Retrieves a specific post and its thread (replies).
  
  ## Query Parameters
  - `uri` (string): The AT-URI of the post
  - `depth` (number, optional): How deep to fetch replies
  
  **Note:** Replace the rkey (last part of URI) with an actual post ID from your account.
}

